WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:01.765 --> 00:04.301 align:center line:81%
My dear brothers and sisters,

00:05.168 --> 00:09.406 align:center line:79%
I feel the love of the Lord
as we meet together.

00:10.707 --> 00:13.310 align:center line:81%
I am humbled to speak with you.

00:15.078 --> 00:17.681 align:center line:81%
I pray that the Spirit will carry

00:17.681 --> 00:23.820 align:center line:79%
into your hearts what the Lord
would have you hear, far beyond the words

00:23.820 --> 00:24.988 align:center line:81%
which I will speak.

00:26.456 --> 00:33.564 align:center line:79%
Long ago, I sought to learn physics
and mathematics in my college years.

00:35.299 --> 00:37.000 align:center line:81%
I felt overwhelmed.

00:38.135 --> 00:43.440 align:center line:79%
I began to feel that I was trying
to learn something that was beyond me.

00:44.575 --> 00:50.047 align:center line:79%
The more I felt overwhelmed, the less
I felt the strength to keep trying.

00:50.948 --> 00:57.254 align:center line:79%
My discouragement led me to feel
that my efforts were almost fruitless.

00:58.455 --> 01:03.327 align:center line:79%
I began to think of quitting,
of doing something easier.

01:04.895 --> 01:06.029 align:center line:81%
I felt weak.

01:07.798 --> 01:13.637 align:center line:79%
As I prayed, I felt the quiet
assurance of the Lord.

01:15.038 --> 01:18.075 align:center line:81%
I felt him say to my mind,

01:19.276 --> 01:24.514 align:center line:81%
“I’m proving you, but I am also with you.”

01:26.249 --> 01:32.990 align:center line:79%
I did not know then all that those words
meant, but I knew what to do—

01:33.256 --> 01:34.391 align:center line:81%
I went to work.

01:36.026 --> 01:38.061 align:center line:81%
By pondering and working

01:38.528 --> 01:40.263 align:center line:81%
during the years that followed,

01:40.831 --> 01:48.038 align:center line:79%
I came to understand this message
of encouragement in the scriptures:

01:49.773 --> 01:56.747 align:center line:79%
“I can do all things through
Christ which strengtheneth me.”

01:58.982 --> 02:05.856 align:center line:79%
I learned that my struggle with physics
was actually a gift from the Lord.

02:06.857 --> 02:11.161 align:center line:81%
He was teaching me that with His help,

02:12.095 --> 02:16.500 align:center line:81%
I could do things that seemed impossible

02:16.800 --> 02:21.638 align:center line:79%
if I had the faith
that He would be there to help me.

02:23.440 --> 02:31.014 align:center line:79%
Through this gift, the Lord was working
to prove and strengthen me.

02:32.416 --> 02:35.118 align:center line:81%
The word “prove” has several meanings.

02:35.652 --> 02:39.456 align:center line:79%
To prove something is not
simply to test it.

02:40.323 --> 02:42.859 align:center line:81%
It is to increase its strength.

02:44.161 --> 02:49.066 align:center line:79%
To prove a piece of steel is
to place it under strain.

02:49.466 --> 02:55.839 align:center line:79%
Heat, weight, and pressure
are added, until its true

02:55.839 --> 02:59.776 align:center line:81%
nature is enhanced and revealed.

03:00.944 --> 03:04.781 align:center line:81%
The steel is not weakened by the proving.

03:05.882 --> 03:10.353 align:center line:79%
In fact, it becomes
something that can be trusted,

03:10.854 --> 03:15.325 align:center line:79%
something strong enough
to bear greater burdens.

03:16.927 --> 03:20.630 align:center line:81%
The Lord proves us in much the same way

03:21.732 --> 03:23.433 align:center line:81%
to strengthen us.

03:24.668 --> 03:30.207 align:center line:79%
That proving does not come
in moments of ease or comfort.

03:30.974 --> 03:36.079 align:center line:79%
It comes in moments when we feel
stretched beyond what we thought

03:36.079 --> 03:37.080 align:center line:81%
we could bear.

03:38.148 --> 03:41.351 align:center line:79%
The Lord teaches
that we are to continue to grow

03:42.018 --> 03:44.855 align:center line:81%
and never tire in our efforts,

03:45.155 --> 03:48.859 align:center line:79%
that we never give up,
that we keep trying.

03:51.495 --> 03:54.765 align:center line:79%
When we continue
to have faith in Jesus Christ—

03:55.432 --> 04:00.003 align:center line:79%
even when things might feel impossible
for us at the moment—

04:00.837 --> 04:03.573 align:center line:81%
we become spiritually stronger.

04:05.375 --> 04:10.514 align:center line:79%
The sacred scripture
records emphasize this truth.

04:11.815 --> 04:14.151 align:center line:81%
The prophet Moroni, for instance,

04:14.584 --> 04:22.025 align:center line:79%
was proved and strengthened in such
a way. He lived his final years alone.

04:23.093 --> 04:26.930 align:center line:79%
He wrote that he had no friends,
that his father had been killed,

04:27.430 --> 04:29.666 align:center line:81%
that his people had been destroyed.

04:31.134 --> 04:34.237 align:center line:79%
He was hunted by
those who sought his life.

04:35.172 --> 04:38.108 align:center line:81%
Yet Moroni did not despair.

04:38.909 --> 04:44.514 align:center line:79%
Instead, he engraved his testimony
of Jesus Christ on plates

04:44.848 --> 04:47.818 align:center line:81%
for people he would not live to see,

04:48.618 --> 04:53.056 align:center line:79%
including the descendants of the people
who desired to kill him.

04:54.057 --> 04:58.929 align:center line:79%
He wrote for us. He knew
that some would mock his words.

04:59.196 --> 05:01.198 align:center line:81%
He knew that some would reject them.

05:01.598 --> 05:03.400 align:center line:81%
Yet he kept writing.

05:04.868 --> 05:11.107 align:center line:79%
In his proving, Moroni’s
faith was refined and strengthened.

05:11.808 --> 05:13.443 align:center line:81%
It became more pure.

05:14.544 --> 05:20.217 align:center line:79%
His words carry the power of one
who endured faithfully to the end.

05:21.585 --> 05:26.223 align:center line:79%
We can feel that power
as we read his testimony:

05:27.657 --> 05:30.126 align:center line:81%
“Now I, Moroni,

05:31.228 --> 05:36.533 align:center line:79%
write somewhat as seemeth me good; and I
write unto my brethren, the Lamanites;

05:36.933 --> 05:41.771 align:center line:79%
and I would that they should know that
more than four hundred and twenty years

05:42.005 --> 05:48.378 align:center line:79%
have passed away since the sign was given
of the coming of Christ.

05:49.446 --> 05:55.652 align:center line:79%
“And I seal up these records,
after I have spoken a few words by way

05:55.652 --> 05:57.821 align:center line:81%
of exhortation unto you.

05:58.221 --> 06:03.093 align:center line:79%
“Behold, I would exhort you that when
ye shall read these things,

06:03.360 --> 06:06.496 align:center line:79%
if it be wisdom in God
that ye should read them,

06:07.163 --> 06:12.535 align:center line:79%
that ye would remember how merciful
the Lord hath been unto the children

06:12.569 --> 06:16.039 align:center line:81%
of men, from the creation of Adam

06:16.539 --> 06:21.211 align:center line:79%
even down until the time
that ye shall receive these things,

06:21.511 --> 06:23.580 align:center line:81%
and ponder it in your hearts.

06:24.447 --> 06:26.883 align:center line:81%
“And when ye shall receive these things,

06:26.883 --> 06:31.655 align:center line:79%
I would exhort you that ye
would ask God, the Eternal Father,

06:32.055 --> 06:36.393 align:center line:79%
in the name of Christ,
if these things are not true;

06:37.060 --> 06:41.998 align:center line:79%
and if ye shall ask with a sincere
heart, with real intent,

06:42.399 --> 06:44.134 align:center line:81%
having faith in Christ,

06:44.601 --> 06:51.041 align:center line:79%
he will manifest the truth of it
unto you, by the power of the Holy Ghost.

06:51.408 --> 06:58.114 align:center line:79%
“And by the power of the Holy Ghost,
ye may know the truth of all things.”

06:59.349 --> 07:05.255 align:center line:79%
Moroni’s testimony
was refined in loneliness,

07:05.789 --> 07:12.062 align:center line:79%
but it shines with light to guide all
generations to seek our Father in Heaven

07:12.462 --> 07:14.998 align:center line:81%
and the Savior Jesus Christ.

07:16.066 --> 07:18.668 align:center line:81%
Another Book of Mormon prophet, Jacob,

07:19.269 --> 07:26.276 align:center line:79%
was proved and strengthened as a child
who experienced afflictions

07:26.509 --> 07:30.380 align:center line:81%
and much sorrow. But his father, Lehi,

07:31.214 --> 07:35.618 align:center line:79%
taught him God would bless
him through his trials.

07:37.120 --> 07:42.492 align:center line:79%
“And behold, in thy childhood thou
hast suffered afflictions and much sorrow

07:42.892 --> 07:45.528 align:center line:81%
because of the rudeness of thy brethren.

07:45.528 --> 07:50.033 align:center line:79%
“Nevertheless, Jacob,
my firstborn in the wilderness,

07:50.333 --> 07:52.669 align:center line:81%
thou knowest the greatness of God;

07:53.269 --> 07:58.942 align:center line:79%
and he shall consecrate
thine afflictions for thy gain.

07:59.943 --> 08:02.445 align:center line:81%
“Wherefore, thy soul shall be blessed,

08:02.679 --> 08:05.982 align:center line:79%
and thou shalt dwell safely
with thy brother, Nephi;

08:06.583 --> 08:10.086 align:center line:79%
and thy days shall be spent
in the service of thy God.

08:10.887 --> 08:13.456 align:center line:81%
Wherefore, I know that thou art redeemed,

08:13.923 --> 08:17.293 align:center line:79%
because of the righteousness
of thy Redeemer;

08:17.694 --> 08:22.565 align:center line:79%
for thou hast beheld
that in the fulness of time he cometh

08:22.999 --> 08:25.301 align:center line:81%
to bring salvation unto men.”

08:27.070 --> 08:33.143 align:center line:79%
The Prophet Joseph Smith
experienced such proving and strengthening

08:33.343 --> 08:35.078 align:center line:81%
when he was in Liberty Jail.

08:35.779 --> 08:40.083 align:center line:79%
In the depths of anguish, the
Prophet Joseph cried out,

08:40.083 --> 08:42.719 align:center line:81%
“O God, where art thou?”

08:43.420 --> 08:45.989 align:center line:81%
“How long shall thy hand be stayed?”

08:47.090 --> 08:54.097 align:center line:79%
The Lord saw in Joseph’s suffering
the sanctifying effect of his enduring it

08:54.097 --> 08:59.669 align:center line:79%
well when he replied,
“My son, peace be unto thy soul;

08:59.936 --> 09:05.175 align:center line:79%
thine adversity and thine
afflictions shall be but a small moment;

09:05.675 --> 09:08.578 align:center line:81%
“And then, if thou endure it well,

09:08.978 --> 09:17.687 align:center line:79%
God shall exalt thee on high; thou
shalt triumph over all thy foes.”

09:19.255 --> 09:22.759 align:center line:79%
The greatest example of proving
and strengthening occurred

09:23.193 --> 09:25.095 align:center line:81%
through the Savior's Atonement.

09:25.562 --> 09:27.997 align:center line:81%
He took upon Him the sins of the world.

09:28.598 --> 09:31.201 align:center line:81%
He bore our pains and our sorrows.

09:31.734 --> 09:33.536 align:center line:81%
He drank the bitter cup.

09:34.170 --> 09:36.473 align:center line:81%
He proved faithful in every moment.

09:37.474 --> 09:40.243 align:center line:81%
Because of his glorious Atonement,

09:40.643 --> 09:45.315 align:center line:79%
Jesus Christ can strengthen us
in our times of trial.

09:45.882 --> 09:47.750 align:center line:81%
He knows how to succor us

09:48.051 --> 09:53.756 align:center line:79%
because he has felt all the challenges
that we will ever feel in mortality.

09:54.924 --> 09:58.828 align:center line:79%
“He will take upon him the pains
and the sicknesses of his people ...

09:59.195 --> 10:05.034 align:center line:79%
that he may know according to the flesh
how to succor his people according

10:05.235 --> 10:06.970 align:center line:81%
to their infirmities.”

10:08.938 --> 10:12.275 align:center line:79%
We learn that while
in the Garden of Gethsemane,

10:12.675 --> 10:17.680 align:center line:79%
the Savior did ask the Father
if the trial could pass over Him—

10:18.314 --> 10:22.385 align:center line:79%
and then He also said,
if it was the Father’s will,

10:22.785 --> 10:24.587 align:center line:81%
then the Savior would do it.

10:25.355 --> 10:30.160 align:center line:79%
In other words, the Savior even took
on doubt and uncertainty,

10:30.593 --> 10:33.830 align:center line:81%
But He had faith in His Heavenly Father.

10:34.797 --> 10:36.199 align:center line:81%
Brothers and sisters,

10:36.199 --> 10:42.639 align:center line:79%
you’re proving and strengthening
may not look like Moroni’s, or Jacob’s,

10:43.039 --> 10:46.543 align:center line:81%
or the Prophet Joseph’s. But it will come.

10:47.610 --> 10:52.515 align:center line:79%
It may come quietly, through
the trials of family life.

10:53.550 --> 11:00.690 align:center line:79%
It may come through illness, or
disappointment, or grief, or loneliness.

11:01.824 --> 11:06.362 align:center line:79%
I bear witness that these
moments are not evidence

11:06.362 --> 11:09.732 align:center line:81%
evidence that the Lord has abandoned you.

11:10.166 --> 11:13.937 align:center line:79%
Rather, they are evidence
that He loves you enough

11:14.137 --> 11:17.106 align:center line:81%
to refine and strengthen you.

11:18.575 --> 11:24.614 align:center line:79%
He is making you strong enough
to carry the weight of eternal life.

11:25.748 --> 11:32.622 align:center line:79%
If we remain faithful in our service,
the Lord will refine us.

11:33.323 --> 11:34.691 align:center line:81%
He will strengthen us,

11:35.525 --> 11:38.695 align:center line:81%
and one day we will look back

11:39.229 --> 11:45.802 align:center line:79%
and see that those very
trials were evidence of His love.

11:47.003 --> 11:54.010 align:center line:79%
We will see that He was shaping us
to be able to stand with him in glory.

11:56.646 --> 12:01.684 align:center line:79%
As the Lord's Apostle Paul
stated at the end of his own life,

12:02.418 --> 12:04.887 align:center line:81%
“I have fought a good fight,

12:05.521 --> 12:07.757 align:center line:81%
I have finished my course,

12:08.591 --> 12:10.593 align:center line:81%
I have kept the faith.”

12:11.828 --> 12:15.031 align:center line:81%
I testify that God knows you.

12:15.898 --> 12:18.368 align:center line:81%
He knows the trials you face.

12:19.068 --> 12:20.370 align:center line:81%
He is with you.

12:21.437 --> 12:23.439 align:center line:81%
He will not forsake you.

12:25.275 --> 12:30.647 align:center line:79%
I testify that Jesus Christ
is the Son of God.

12:31.314 --> 12:36.052 align:center line:79%
He is our strength,
our Redeemer, our hope.

12:37.320 --> 12:43.459 align:center line:79%
If we trust Him, he will make
our spiritual power equal

12:43.993 --> 12:47.630 align:center line:81%
to every trial we are called to bear.

12:49.732 --> 12:55.271 align:center line:79%
I so testify in the sacred name
of Jesus Christ,

12:55.571 --> 12:57.006 align:center line:81%
amen.

